How to use it

Run Airmouse.exe

🖐🏻 Open hand to freely move mouse
👆🏻 Left click - touch index finger joint with thumb to perform clean single left click
✌🏻 Right click - make victory sign and join pinky ring and middle finger in front of camera
👆🏻Scroll Up -  index finger and thumb make sure thumb isn't touching index finger and show this sing up to scroll up
👇🏻Scroll Down -  opposite basically do not touch the thumb to index and show then sign downside to scroll down

